<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-017-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.145341" lon="-120.790888"><name>SC26-017-C</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 5.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 45/100; not catch probability. Center 88 ft; nearby 87–108 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-001</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.14669457800077" lon="-120.7934305465893"/><trkpt lat="35.146424262489944" lon="-120.79343784651391"/><trkpt lat="35.146414268107726" lon="-120.79288933999322"/><trkpt lat="35.146232058665305" lon="-120.79278450673273"/><trkpt lat="35.14533100723428" lon="-120.79280884614067"/><trkpt lat="35.14528099762974" lon="-120.79006635407853"/><trkpt lat="35.145377107059936" lon="-120.79039301622107"/><trkpt lat="35.14564742206198" lon="-120.79038570651164"/><trkpt lat="35.14565142457012" lon="-120.79060510665867"/><trkpt lat="35.14610194961018" lon="-120.79059292480063"/><trkpt lat="35.146107952727974" lon="-120.79092202691322"/><trkpt lat="35.145747532619154" lon="-120.79093177097252"/><trkpt lat="35.1457715358421" lon="-120.79224817460073"/><trkpt lat="35.14640427124509" lon="-120.79234083374257"/><trkpt lat="35.14669457800077" lon="-120.7934305465893"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
